    },
    {
      "id": "block",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## BLOCK｜R3先阻断\n\n- 领域狭义事务清单\n- apply_is_a_narrow_semantics.py\n- apply_ten_yuan_mapping_degree.py\n- apply_ten_yuan_archetype_accuracy.py\n- rebuild_five_element_canvases.py\n- rebuild-bangs-five-elements.yml\n- 概念映射流水线/子代理模板\n\n原因：会自动复活旧内核。",
      "x": 100,
